{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"他盼着对方有时也需要他，像有回应\",\"source\":\"他忽然想到自己需要对方，对方有时也需要他；即使对方不需要他，他仍愿意陪着，不再藏着喜欢。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"严重\",\"why\":\"定稿写的是他想到对方有时也需要自己，屏幕稿却改成他盼着对方需要自己，新增了期待对方回应的愿望，改变了他的心态。\"},{\"sec\":\"S13\",\"screen\":\"听到不变他仍问【能否一直这样】\",\"source\":\"可就算听到了，他越喜欢跟对方待着，越觉得时间过得快，真能一直这样吗？\",\"type\":\"3\",\"severity\":\"严重\",\"why\":\"定稿只是设想即使听到保证仍会怀疑，屏幕稿省掉了假设条件，容易让观众以为对方已经说过以后不变。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e1e9e024-a77b-4ac3-a8a8-c937307b3969", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T081354093072Z", "elapsed_seconds": 496.89, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T08:22:10.995379+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3b3f41c3d85800d65c15164c8cfb6a10492c4cb13e8be6ba4738480d6d4faa81", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_atta